{#
	A person with an account (owner, 2026-10-21): their name, linked to their profile (href) when the reader may open it.
	full: the page's own person - the person or account the page is about (an order, a ledger entry, a wallet, a message) -
	named once with everything about them, each on its own line under the page's title: the linked name, the account
	reference and the email address ("Put them each on their own line, stacked ... It's only necessary to supply this
	additional info ONCE on a page", "never push this extra info into table listings"). Every other mention, and every
	table, is the linked name alone.
#}
{% set name %}<span class="cl-ui-person-name">{{ props.name }}</span>{% endset %}
{% set linked %}{% if props.href %}<a class="cl-ui-person-account" href="{{ props.href }}">{{ name }}</a>{% else %}{{ name }}{% endif %}{% endset %}
{% if props.full %}<span class="cl-ui-person cl-ui-person--full"><span class="cl-ui-person-line">{{ linked }}</span>{% if props.reference %}<span class="cl-ui-person-line cl-ui-person-reference">{{ props.reference|account_reference }}</span>{% endif %}{% if props.email %}<span class="cl-ui-person-line"><a class="cl-ui-person-email" href="mailto:{{ props.email }}">{{ props.email }}</a></span>{% endif %}</span>{% else %}<span class="cl-ui-person">{{ linked }}</span>{% endif %}{# Ends at a tag, so text written straight after a person (a full stop) gains no space. #}
